<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Suburban Lodge upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Suburban Lodge upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns upgraded its rating on the shares of Suburban Lodges of America Inc to attractive from neutral, a source at the brokerage firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 15/16 to 19-3/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
</text>
